Whitespace, tabs and blank source lines survive. Long source lines wrap visibly with a diagnostic.
-- input.1 --
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
  tool --flag
	one tab

    A deliberately long preformatted line that must wrap rather than be cropped at the canvas edge.
last
.EE
-- options.json --
{"Width":420,"PageHeight":500,"Margin":24}
